Pwnsat Browser Lab
==================

This project reuses two files from the original Pwnsat / FlatSat satellite
security workshop by "astrobyte":

  firmware/spp.cpp, firmware/spp.h  — SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
  tools/pwnsat_protocol.py          — CCSDS SPP + AES-128 helper (from the workshop tools)

These are vendored unmodified so the lab is self-contained. The firmware files
carry GPL-2.0-or-later headers; this repository is therefore distributed under
GPL-2.0-or-later (see LICENSE). The intentionally-vulnerable code, flags and the
AES candidate key list (keys.txt) are training artifacts, not real secrets.

The original workshop materials (the book, PDFs, packet captures, wordlists and
the full ground-station tooling) are NOT included here.
